    "gold-law": "same as kogane: gold is gilding, never a slab. Primary button = paper surface (ink-2) + 1.5px gold border (kin-1) + gold text (kin-t). No gold-filled rectangles.",
    "terminal": "NOT inverted — the terminal is always a kogane-dark island (#0B0A08) pinned to the paper"
  },
